message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyuncop (동현콥): a one-button flight laboratory that runs a classic Flash cave-flight game unmodified, flies Podongi's tail-copter, and sets its speed through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.2"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23787094"
authors:
